    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/",
    "note": "Wave-1 row 104 named the Quaternius Zombie from 'Animated models (misc)' on poly.pizza (now behind a Cloudflare challenge). Substituted with Zombie_Male from the Quaternius Ultimate Animated Character Pack (Nov 2019) on OpenGameArt (same zip and pin as man-casual and worker). Chosen over Zombie_Female in the same pack: the male's open skull with the brain showing, bare scalp, scowl and torn shirt read as a zombie at a glance, while the female's long hair hides the face and the head wound. It ships the pack's 11 clips (idle, walk, punch, hit, sit, walk-carry, pick-up, one-handed shoot, victory, defeat, stand-up), not the misc set's 8 (no run, jump or death). The source skin is green; no colour script has a green, so it is painted indigo's cold moon-white (bloodless, corpse-pale) with red eyes, brain and guts. Alternative: Kenney's blocky mini character-zombie (Kenney kits, CC0), not used: far less modelled."
  },
